":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"2C-x","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Cannabis","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"DOx","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"MDMA","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Mescaline","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Nbome","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."}],"citations":[],"helpfulLinks":[{"title":"PsychonautWiki","description":"Pharmacology, subjective effects, and dosage reference","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/5-MeO-DALT"},{"title":"TripSit Factsheet","description":"Rapid harm-reduction summary and combination data","url":"https://drugs.tripsit.me/5-meo-dalt"},{"title":"Erowid Experience Vaults","description":"First-person experience reports and archives","url":"https://www.erowid.org/experiences/subs/exp_5MeODALT.shtml"},{"title":"Wikipedia","description":"Encyclopedia article","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/5-MeO-DALT"},{"title":"Wikidata","description":"Structured data on 5-MeO-DALT","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q9134216"},{"title":"維基百科","description":"zh:Encyclopedia article","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-tw/5-MeO-DALT"}],"wikidata":"Q9134216","formula":"C17H22N2O","molarMass":270.37,"pharmacology":{"text":"The interactions of 5-MeO-DALT with various targets have been reported. It binds to a variety of serotonin receptors, as well as a number of other targets. The drug is a potent full agonist of the serotonin 5-HT1A and 5-HT2A receptors. It is also an agonist of the serotonin 5-HT2B and 5-HT2C receptors.","source":"Wikipedia","page":"5-MeO-DALT","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/5-MeO-DALT#Pharmacodynamics","kind":"Serotonin receptor agonist; Serotonergic psychedelic; Hallucinogen","figures":"5-MeO-DALT"},"uses":{"text":"It has been encountered as a novel designer and recreational drug.","source":"Wikipedia","page":"5-MeO-DALT","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/5-MeO-DALT","brands":"Foxtrot","routes":"Oral","figures":"5-MeO-DALT"},"summaryZh":"5-MeO-DALT是一種色胺衍生物，化學式為C17H22N2O，可作為迷幻藥物，由亞歷山大·舒爾金開發。","ai":{"by":"Claude (Anthropic)","date":"2026-11-27","sideEffects":{"en":"Little is known about it in people. Drugs of its class, the psychedelic tryptamines, can cause nausea, dilated pupils, muscle tension, a faster heartbeat, anxiety, confusion and frightening experiences. In people at risk, they can trigger lasting mental health problems such as psychosis.","zh":"目前對它在人體的作用所知甚少。與它同類的迷幻色胺類藥物，可能引起噁心、瞳孔放大、肌肉緊繃、心跳加快、焦慮、意識混亂與驚恐的經驗。對本身有風險的人，可能誘發精神病等持久的心理健康問題。","zhHans":"目前对它在人体的作用所知甚少。与它同类的迷幻色胺类药物，可能引起恶心、瞳孔放大、肌肉紧绷、心跳加快、焦虑、意识混乱与惊恐的经验。对本身有风险的人，可能诱发精神病等持久的心理健康问题。"},"fact":{"en":"Alexander Shulgin designed it late in his life, around 2004, and published the recipe freely rather than patenting it. The DALT in its name stands for its two allyl chains, groups named after garlic.","zh":"Alexander Shulgin在晚年、約2004年設計了它，並免費公開合成方法而未申請專利。名稱中的「DALT」指它的兩條烯丙基鏈，而這個基團的名稱源自大蒜。","zhHans":"Alexander Shulgin在晚年、约2004年设计了它，并免费公开合成方法而未申请专利。名称中的「DALT」指它的两条烯丙基链，而这个基团的名称源自大蒜。"}}}